  "kind": "unlock-state-machine",
  "description": "Extension: the unlock is active, the service worker restarts (new in-memory boot id) and the wall clock is set back. Without a current-boot anchor nothing is usable; after a fresh anchor the activation from the old boot needs revalidation, and revalidation finds it already over.",
